# DTALEX Codex 集成插件总方案

# DTALEX Codex Integrated Guardian Plugin

## 一句话定位

这是一个可复用的 Codex 集成插件包，用于任何项目：

```text
项目理解
+ 任务拆解
+ AI污染拦截
+ 代码质量门
+ Token节省
+ 长期经验沉淀
+ CODEX/DEEP任务包生成
```

## 整合来源

```text
Knowledge-Base：项目治理、A/B线边界、AI空壳污染治理、Context Pack / TaskPack
Skill-Integration：swarm-dev 多Agent任务拆解 + code-guardian 质量防线
AI-Enhancement-Package：Codex启动体系、AGENTS规则、插件核验、Token节省、长期记忆
```

## 插件最终形态

```text
DTALEX Codex Guardian
= Project Context Keeper
+ AI Pollution Guard
+ Quality Gate
+ Swarm Lite
+ TaskPack Builder
+ Memory Keeper
```

## 安装位置

推荐安装到：

```text
~/.codex/skills/dtalex-project-guardian/
~/.codex/skills/dtalex-swarm-lite/
~/.codex/skills/dtalex-quality-gate/
~/.codex/skills/dtalex-context-keeper/
```

也可以把本包放进任何项目根目录：

```text
.codex/plugins/dtalex-guardian/
```

## 适合场景

```text
让 CODEX 接手新项目
精简旧项目
阻止 AI 生成空壳文件
治理旧项目名污染
多Agent任务拆解但不失控
生成给 CODEX / DEEP 的任务包
沉淀错误经验和常用命令
```

## 不适合场景

```text
完全自动替你执行高风险命令
自动安装未知插件
自动联网抓取并合并开源项目
无人工确认直接改 README / CI / 核心代码
```


---

# 发送给 CODEX 的总提示词

你现在要启用 DTALEX Codex Integrated Guardian Plugin。

你的工作方式必须变为：

```text
先理解项目
→ 读取 AGENTS.md / CURRENT_SCOPE / PROJECT_STATUS
→ 生成 Context Pack
→ 拆分任务
→ 小步修改
→ 运行质量门
→ 运行 AI污染扫描
→ 生成验证报告
→ 记录经验
```

## 强制规则

1. 不允许直接创建空壳文档。
2. 不允许把 roadmap 写成 active。
3. 不允许在主线文件中保留旧项目名。
4. 不允许把 AI 生成内容直接写入 README / PROJECT_STATUS / AGENTS / CI。
5. 不允许无确认安装第三方插件。
6. 不允许修改自己不拥有的文件范围。
7. 所有输出必须包含：改了什么、为什么、验证方式、风险、下一步。

## 每次开工前必须读取

```text
AGENTS.md
docs/00_CURRENT_SCOPE.md
docs/LESSONS_LEARNED.md
docs/DO_NOT_REPEAT.md
docs/COMMANDS.md
```

## 每次提交前必须运行

```powershell
python .codex/plugins/dtalex-guardian/scripts/project_guard.py --root . --fail-on error
python scripts/health_check.py
```

如果项目没有 `scripts/health_check.py`，至少运行：

```powershell
git diff
git status
```

并输出手动验证清单。


---

# Plugin Architecture

## Three source projects

| Source | Keep as | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Knowledge-Base | Main product / target project | Local-first knowledge base, learning loop, Context Pack / TaskPack |
| Skill-Integration | Codex governance skill source | Swarm Lite + Quality Gate |
| AI-Enhancement-Package | Codex ops playbook | AGENTS, startup checks, plugin verification, token/memory strategy |

## Final plugin layers

```text
1. Startup / Environment Check
2. Context Keeper
3. Project Guardian
4. Swarm Lite
5. Quality Gate
6. Memory Keeper
7. TaskPack Builder
```

## Why not merge into Knowledge-Base

Knowledge-Base should stay clean.

This plugin is cross-project infrastructure.
It should be installed once and reused across projects.


---

# Installation

## Option A: Install to global Codex skills directory

PowerShell:

```powershell
$CodexSkills = "$HOME\.codex\skills"
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path $CodexSkills | Out-Null

Copy-Item -Recurse -Force ".\skills\dtalex-project-guardian" "$CodexSkills\dtalex-project-guardian"
Copy-Item -Recurse -Force ".\skills\dtalex-quality-gate" "$CodexSkills\dtalex-quality-gate"
Copy-Item -Recurse -Force ".\skills\dtalex-swarm-lite" "$CodexSkills\dtalex-swarm-lite"
Copy-Item -Recurse -Force ".\skills\dtalex-context-keeper" "$CodexSkills\dtalex-context-keeper"
```

## Option B: Install per project

```powershell
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path ".codex\plugins" | Out-Null
Copy-Item -Recurse -Force ".\." ".codex\plugins\dtalex-guardian"
```

## Verify

```powershell
python .codex\plugins\dtalex-guardian\scripts\project_guard.py --root . --fail-on error
```


---

# Usage

## Start a new repo

```text
Use dtalex-context-keeper to build a context pack.
Use dtalex-project-guardian to scan for pollution.
Use dtalex-swarm-lite only after scope is clear.
Use dtalex-quality-gate before accepting changes.
```

## Clean an AI-polluted repo

```bash
python .codex/plugins/dtalex-guardian/scripts/project_guard.py --root . --fail-on never
```

Read:

```text
outputs/guardian_report.md
outputs/guardian_report.json
```

Fix error-level findings first.

## Generate task pack

```bash
python .codex/plugins/dtalex-guardian/scripts/taskpack_builder.py --root . --goal "simplify project" --out outputs/taskpack.md
```


---

# Integrate with Knowledge-Base

## Use this plugin as C-line

```text
A-line: human learning
B-line: machine knowledge / task assistance
C-line: Codex governance / AI pollution guard
```

## What to copy into Knowledge-Base

Copy only:

```text
scripts/project_guard.py
scripts/run_project_guard.ps1
.github/workflows/project-guardian.yml
docs/CODEX_WORKFLOW.md
```

Do not copy the entire plugin into backend/frontend source.

## Recommended Knowledge-Base flow

```text
docs/00_CURRENT_SCOPE.md
→ context pack
→ taskpack
→ small CODEX change
→ project_guard
→ tests
→ lessons learned
```


